      "updated": 1719977367383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 10.88571304009795,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "存储地址引用的复杂对象\n访问堆区内存时，一般是先通过对象读取到对象\n所在的栈区的指针地址，然后通过指针地址访问堆区。",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "存储地址引用的复杂对象\n访问堆区内存时，一般是先通过对象读取到对象\n所在的栈区的指针地址，然后通过指针地址访问堆区。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 589,
      "versionNonce": 1202699552,
      "index": "b1F",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "a83P03A3wPikHfxFsrQH3",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 820.4401245117188,
      "y": 534.5892880498163,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#846358",
      "width": 391.67962646484375,
      "height": 40.82142390036732,
      "seed": 868928736,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1719977885454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 10.88571304009795,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "全局区变量可读可写\n未初始化的全局变量和static静态变量，即BSS区（Block Started by Symbol）\n已初始化的全局变量和staic静态变量，即数据区（Initialized Data）",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "全局区变量可读可写\n未初始化的全局变量和static静态变量，即BSS区（Block Started by Symbol）\n已初始化的全局变量和staic静态变量，即数据区（Initialized Data）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 676,
      "versionNonce": 1263680800,
      "index": "b1G",
      "isDeleted": false,
